        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-595.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-595-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH596-HEX-DAT-EQ-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH597-QUAD-CHAIN-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH598-HEX-DAT-LAT-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH599-600M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH600-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-595-WIT      PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-BEYOND-595.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-BEYOND-595.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH596-HEX-DAT-EQ-OK = 1 AND
